# Example DNP3 link frames for the dnp3-dpi decoder.
#
# Each line is one hex-encoded link frame with valid CRC-16/DNP header and
# data-block checksums.

# Direct Operate (function 5) on a binary-output control object (group 12,
# variation 1), control code 3 (LATCH_ON), from link address 3 to address 1.
05641044010003001e25c0c0050c01170000000003f19c

# Disable Unsolicited (function 21) from link address 3 to address 1.
056408440100030003c7c0c0157ecb

# Cold Restart (function 13) from link address 3 to address 1.
056408440100030003c7c0c00d9c86
